{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S11（22秒）和 S12（25秒）等短段落中，话与感受安排得偏密，观众可能来不及逐项扫完；Y 的双栏布局在这些段落更容易快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的【】能让观众在听音乐时迅速抓住每段叙事的关键转折，不必读完所有文字才能明白发生了什么；感受分组并随音乐时机出现，也比 Y 将大量短词同时铺在右侧更容易建立文字与音乐的对应。人物从离开后的失落、反复怀念与挣扎，到承认矛盾、带着想念继续生活，前后因果和情感变化在 X 中更清楚；音乐感受也有更多具体的节奏、音型、音响和身体反应，不只是笼统的情绪命名。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5271dd95-d8fa-46c3-80c2-43401bc6ce94", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010828502435Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:09:35.294443+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d5fdd3d3a36b244f006b89ce6d40e7241a307cf7bb7e7556f4d05bad72d80c36", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c